{
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "updated": "2026-09-18",
  "authority": "plane-spaces",
  "purpose": "Turn Heaven, World and Below from topic filters into inhabitable navigation spaces with named zones, functions, Room projections and explicit transitions. These are symbolic reader spaces over the same House, not separate universes.",
  "master_rules": [
    "Heaven is the Garden-facing upper space: integration, House, Crown/North, Tree canopy, Mountain/Summit, Fruit and return.",
    "World is the lived middle space: bodies, institutions, evidence, roads, public culture, history, work, choice and consequence.",
    "Below is the root/repair/entanglement lower space: Archive/Root, Seed burial, Ash/Mud, Shadow, Wide Road, Swamp and Forge.",
    "Forge and Swamp are both Below but are not equivalent: Swamp is unresolved entanglement; Forge is bounded transformation/repair.",
    "The center repeats locally. Every Room, Door and process may have a scoped local center/junction while Potato of Life remains global semantic center and Axis remains global spatial orientation.",
    "A local center is where the current Room asks its governing question, receives inputs, performs its transition/test, and hands work onward."
  ],
